
.kt-card-header
  %h3.kt-card-title
    = t('activerecord.models.workspace')
.kt-card-content
  %p.text-sm.text-foreground-secondary
    The Space is the final execution unit. It groups in an isolated way your
    %b configuration variables
    (key/values), your
    %b license information,
    your
    %b KPIs
    and your
    %b infrastructure files
    (Terraform).
